# Git and CI

- Conventional commits scoped by lab part: `feat(part2): add chromadb ingestion`,
  `test(part5): add recall@k harness`, `fix(part6): exclude legacy PTO v1`.
- One feature branch per part (`part-2-chunking`), merged to `main` once tests pass.
- Never commit `.venv/`, `.env`, `chroma/` persistence dirs, or model caches.
- CI (Part 8 only): Python 3.11, cache pip, run `ruff check`, `mypy src`, and
  `pytest -m "not integration"`. Fail the build on any error.
